`reg 21: the person is present in Canada for the purposes of the Act and these Regulations` `the person is present in Canada under paragraph (1)(b)` `an interval of absence is deemed not to have interrupted the person's presence under subsection (4) or (5.1)` `a period is considered a period of presence in Canada under subsection (3)` MEANS
        `the person is present in Canada under paragraph (1)(b)`
    OR  `an interval of absence is deemed not to have interrupted the person's presence under subsection (4) or (5.1)`
    OR  `a period is considered a period of presence in Canada under subsection (3)`

